          "PromptText": null,
          "PromptTextConfidence": "KnubotAppendText U2=1+0 capture 20260806-naleb-transport",
          "PromptSegments": [
            {
              "Text": "The nano mage female turns to you and her white eyes bore into you. She looks blind, but somehow you know she isn't, and can actually see much more than an average person.",
              "Unknown2": 1
            },
            {
              "Text": "Child, my Awoken name is Zyvania Bagh. I am the Third of the Nelebai.",
              "Unknown2": 0
            }
          ],
          "Options": [
            {
              "Id": "zyvania_002_0",
              "Index": 0,
              "Text": "The Nelebai?",
              "TextEvidence": "capture 20260806-naleb-transport",
              "NextNodeId": "zyvania_003",
              "Actions": []
            },
            {
              "Id": "zyvania_002_1",
              "Index": 1,
              "Text": "Goodbye",
              "TextEvidence": "capture 20260806-naleb-transport",
              "NextNodeId": "zyvania_close",
              "Actions": [
                {
                  "Id": "zyvania_002_1_end",
                  "Type": "EndDialogue",
                  "QuestId": null,
                  "Text": "Goodbye"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "EnterActions": []
        },
        {
          "Id": "zyvania_003",
          "PromptText": null,
          "PromptTextConfidence": "KnubotAppendText U2=0 capture 20260806-naleb-transport",
          "PromptSegments": [
            {
              "Text": "Yes. We are the Enlightened ones. We have understood the Awareness of Master Neleb, who works from his sanctuary in Omni Forest. I am called the Third because I was the third Sleeper to Awaken.\\n\\nI expect you are familiar with Master Neleb?",
              "Unknown2": 0
            }
          ],
          "Options": [
            {
              "Id": "zyvania_003_0",
              "Index": 0,
              "Text": "No, I don't know what you're talking about.",
              "TextEvidence": "capture 20260806-naleb-transport",
              "NextNodeId": "zyvania_004",
              "Actions": []
            },
            {
              "Id": "zyvania_003_1",
              "Index": 1,
              "Text": "Yes, I've heard of Neleb.",
              "TextEvidence": "capture 20260806-naleb-transport",
              "NextNodeId": "zyvania_seek",
              "Actions": []
            },
            {
              "Id": "zyvania_003_2",
              "Index": 2,
              "Text": "Goodbye",
              "TextEvidence": "capture 20260806-naleb-transport",
              "NextNodeId": "zyvania_close",
              "Actions": [
                {
                  "Id": "zyvania_003_2_end",
                  "Type": "EndDialogue",
                  "QuestId": null,
                  "Text": "Goodbye"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "EnterActions": []
        },
        {
          "Id": "zyvania_004",
          "PromptText": null,
          "PromptTextConfidence": "KnubotAppendText U2=1+0 capture 20260806-naleb-transport",
          "PromptSegments": [
            {
              "Text": "She smiles and closes her eyes halfway.",
              "Unknown2": 1
            },
            {
              "Text": "Then allow me to explain. It is always a privilege to inform a Sleeper as yourself.\\n\\nMaster Neleb had a difficult child hood, like every member of his Nelebai. We have all experienced some sort of abuse, mental or physical. Some were victims of very bad domestic violence, others escaped or were released from test facilities, scarred for life. \\n\\nMaster Neleb also had challenging early years. His foster parents regularly beat him in the cruelest way, he was denied schooling and was eventually thrown out of the home much too early. But, as an adult, he has never carried resentment and vengeance. He is convinced that these challenges were necessary for him to Awaken and find the Path.\\n\\nPerhaps you can experience it too. Will you seek out Master Neleb and discover your Awakening?",
              "Unknown2": 0
            }
          ],
          "Options": [
            {
              "Id": "zyvania_004_0",
              "Index": 0,
              "Text": "Awakening?",
              "TextEvidence": "capture 20260806-naleb-transport",
              "NextNodeId": "zyvania_awakening",
              "Actions": []
            },
            {
              "Id": "zyvania_004_1",
              "Index": 1,
              "Text": "Path?",
              "TextEvidence": "capture 20260806-naleb-transport",
              "NextNodeId": "zyvania_path_from_seek",
              "Actions": []
            },
            {
              "Id": "zyvania_004_2",
              "Index": 2,
              "Text": "Awareness?",
              "TextEvidence": "capture 20260806-naleb-transport",
              "NextNodeId": "zyvania_awareness_from_seek",
              "Actions": []
            },
            {
              "Id": "zyvania_004_3",
