              "Text": "The Path is the life after the Awakening, when the Nelebai have successfully expelled the despair, anger and fear that used to rule our lives. We now live only to explain to people about the great vision and truth of Master Neleb, hoping that more people like ourselves will break free from the chains of past terrors.",
